  <div class="insight-box warn" style="margin-top:16px;">
    <div class="insight-title">Implications for Review Trustworthiness</div>
    <strong>Copilot's low mismatch rate (8.05%)</strong> is consistent with its high overall satisfaction — users feel and say the same thing. For the other four apps, the <strong>12–14% mismatch zone</strong> means that roughly one in eight reviews cannot be taken at face value: a 5-star review may contain hidden frustration, or a 1-star review may contain genuine praise buried in sarcasm. Teams relying solely on star averages for competitor tracking will systematically underestimate dissatisfaction in these apps.
